<p>Release a burst of sunlight beams at <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> random foes in radius 10, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> damage to all foes hit and increasing your bonus light damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64%</acronym> of your bonus darkness damage for 4 turns.</p>